WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.700
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do: Dr. Bright is not allowed to "accidentally"

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.210
spill green gelatin on a dead body.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:14.610
It is well known by SCP staff, particularly
those in the O5 council, that allowing SCP-447's

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:19.710
green slime to come into contact with a dead
body will result in disaster on a catastrophic

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:20.710
scale.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:25.109
Of course, Dr. Bright decided that it would
be hilarious to procure some lime jello from

00:00:25.109 --> 00:00:30.009
the canteen, pretend to trip and fall, and
spill the gelatin all over a body being observed

00:00:30.009 --> 00:00:31.160
by the O5.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.780
Admittedly, the first time, it was a bit funny.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.390
But it was also extremely stressful, multiple
staff fainted, and O5-2 made it a point to

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:43.480
tell Dr. Bright that he "owed him a new pair
of khakis" after the sudden terror had made

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.719
him, well, ruin his.

